WEBVTT

00:03:27.125 --> 00:03:30.226
"Well, you do dress provocatively,

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.768
even a little sexually suggestive,

00:03:33.792 --> 00:03:35.458
attention seeking maybe."

00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:40.184
But just because
a woman's body gets attention,

00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:42.208
doesn't mean she's attention-seeking.

00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:47.184
And what is provocative anyway,
what is sexually suggestive?

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:50.893
In some parts of the world,
showing your ankles

00:03:50.917 --> 00:03:53.458
is promiscuous, is provocative.

00:03:54.917 --> 00:03:58.518
It's just like, no matter
what a woman wears,

00:03:58.542 --> 00:04:02.083
it's always perceived
as more sexual than it is.